      "id": "claim_bdaf158726cc404fb2c14df70c8d66e0",
      "statement": "New loaders should subclass CachedDocumentLoader (which extends the DocumentLoader ABC) to inherit can_handle detection, PDF/URL conversion helpers, vision mode, and TTL caching; caching matters because Process.split and Process.extract each call load() on the same file.",
