      "statement": "The loader convention is a @dataclass config holding content/cache_ttl plus loader-specific options validated in __post_init__ (PyPDFConfig rejects cache_ttl <= 0 and non-string passwords), with loaders accepting either the config object or legacy keyword arguments in __init__.",
