      "id": "claim_864f204a1e134f8b9b9f079a363e345b",
      "statement": "A loader must declare SUPPORTED_FORMATS (extension matching is case-insensitive for paths, python-magic MIME detection for streams) and implement load() returning a list of page dicts that always include 'content', attach 'image'/'images' bytes when vision_mode is on (reusing convert_to_images for PDFs), raise ValueError for unsupported sources and parsing failures, and be decorated with cachedmethod including vision_mode in the hash key.",
